Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:07.41,Campus Common,学園長,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:07.41,Campus Common,学園長,0,0,0,,『Hatsuboshi IDOL FESTIVAL』\n優勝者は――
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:11.05,Campus Common,学園長,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:11.05,Campus Common,学園長,0,0,0,,藤田ことね！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.89,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.89,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,――なんて爽やかな敗北。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:20.75,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:20.75,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,私が見出し育てた、私のスター。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:23.31,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:23.31,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,素敵なライブだったわ。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:29.71,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:29.71,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,なんの心配も憂いもない。\n彼女ならきっと……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:36.66,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:36.66,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,『<r\=プリマステラ>一番星</r>』として皆を導いていける。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:39.73,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:39.73,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,――けれどっ！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:43.18,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:43.18,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,これをハッピーエンドだなんて\n認めないわ！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:48.82,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:48.82,Campus Common,星南,0,0,0,,彼女にとってのスターは、\n私なのだから！
